flowchart LR
A[Telematics / Inspection / PM Trigger] --> B[Defect or Due Event]
B --> C{Safety Critical?}
C -- Yes --> D[Out of Service / Lockout]
C -- No --> E[Plan Work Order]
D --> E
E --> F[Approve and Schedule]
F --> G[Execute Labor and Parts]
G --> H[Quality Verification]
H --> I[Return to Service]
I --> J[Cost, Warranty, Project and Twin Updates]
